{
  "pid": "self-medium-06",
  "source": "selfmade",
  "difficulty": "medium",
  "title": "温度模糊控制与输出钳位（重心法 + 历史误差清除）",
  "requirements": "写一个功能块 FB，用九条规则的温度模糊控制器计算加热功率。\n控制要求：\n1. e = setpoint - temperature；de = (e - ePrev) / scanSeconds，**首拍**或历史被清除时 de = 0；\n2. x = clamp(e / 10.0, -1, 1)，y = clamp(de / 2.0, -1, 1)；\n3. 隶属度：μN(z)=max(-z,0)、μZ(z)=1-|z|、μP(z)=max(z,0)；\n4. 九条规则的单点输出：N×N=-30、N×Z=-20、N×P=-10、Z×N=-10、Z×Z=0、Z×P=10、P×N=10、P×Z=20、P×P=30；correction = Σ(w·c)/Σw（重心法），Σw=0 时 correction=0；\n5. power = clamp(bias + correction, 0, 100)，**correction 不钳位**；\n6. fault = NOT sensorValid OR scanSeconds <= 0.0 OR scanSeconds > 10.0；fault、enable=FALSE 或 resetBtn 上升沿时：power=0、correction=0，并清除历史（ePrev=0、历史标志=FALSE）。\n平台适配：原接口 dt（IEC 日期时间类型别名）统一重命名为 scanSeconds；单位秒、类型及原数字断言不变。",
  "variables": [
    {
      "name": "enable",
      "data_type": "BOOL",
      "description": "自动投入",
      "direction": "input",
      "fields": []
    },
    {
      "name": "resetBtn",
      "data_type": "BOOL",
      "description": "复位（上升沿清除历史误差）",
      "direction": "input",
      "fields": []
    },
    {
      "name": "sensorValid",
      "data_type": "BOOL",
      "description": "温度传感器数据有效",
      "direction": "input",
      "fields": []
    },
    {
      "name": "setpoint",
      "data_type": "REAL",
      "description": "温度设定值（℃）",
      "direction": "input",
      "fields": []
    },
    {
      "name": "temperature",
      "data_type": "REAL",
      "description": "温度测量值（℃）",
      "direction": "input",
      "fields": []
    },
    {
      "name": "scanSeconds",
      "data_type": "REAL",
      "description": "本周期时长（s），合法 0 < dt <= 10",
      "direction": "input",
      "fields": []
    },
    {
      "name": "bias",
      "data_type": "REAL",
      "description": "基础输出（%）",
      "direction": "input",
      "fields": []
    },
    {
      "name": "power",
      "data_type": "REAL",
      "description": "加热功率输出（%），钳位 0..100",
      "direction": "output",
      "fields": []
    },
    {
      "name": "correction",
      "data_type": "REAL",
      "description": "模糊修正量（%）",
      "direction": "output",
      "fields": []
    },
    {
      "name": "fault",
      "data_type": "BOOL",
      "description": "传感器或参数故障",
      "direction": "output",
      "fields": []
    }
  ],
  "target_pou": "FUNCTION_BLOCK",
  "specs": [
    {
      "sid": "S1",
      "text": "加热功率恒在 0..100 之间。",
      "ltl": "G((power >= 0.0) & (power <= 100.0))",
      "kind": "safety",
      "verified_by": "bounded_checker"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S2",
      "text": "模糊修正量恒在 ±30 之间（九个单点输出量的极值）。",
      "ltl": "G((correction >= -30.0) & (correction <= 30.0))",
      "kind": "safety",
      "verified_by": "bounded_checker"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S3",
      "text": "未投入、复位上升沿或故障时，输出与修正必须归零。",
      "ltl": "G((!enable | rising(resetBtn) | fault) -> (power = 0.0 & correction = 0.0))",
      "kind": "safety",
      "verified_by": "bounded_checker"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S4",
      "text": "故障判据：传感器无效或 scanSeconds 越界。",
      "ltl": "G(fault <-> (!sensorValid | scanSeconds <= 0.0 | scanSeconds > 10.0))",
      "kind": "safety",
      "verified_by": "bounded_checker"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S5",
      "text": "传感器无效必然判故障（不允许用坏数据继续闭环）。",
      "ltl": "G(!sensorValid -> fault)",
      "kind": "safety",
      "verified_by": "bounded_checker"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S6",
      "text": "有效工作拍功率为 bias 加修正后的 0..100 钳位；停用、故障或复位拍为零。",
      "ltl": "G(((NOT enable OR fault OR (resetBtn AND NOT prev(resetBtn))) -> power = 0.0) AND (NOT (NOT enable OR fault OR (resetBtn AND NOT prev(resetBtn))) -> ABS(power - LIMIT(0.0, bias + correction, 100.0)) <= 0.000001))",
      "kind": "data",
      "verified_by": "bounded_checker"
    }
  ],
  "test_cases": [
